Package: stridealign
Type: Package
Title: SIMD String Matching and Sequence Alignment
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person("Adam", "DePrince", email = "adam.deprince@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast Unicode-aware string distance, similarity, and sequence
    alignment functions backed by the host-neutral stride-align C++20 core.
    Native code is dispatched at package load to the best compatible SIMD
    backend installed with the package.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://stride-align.com
BugReports: https://github.com/adamdeprince/stride-align/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: C++20
NeedsCompilation: yes
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
